EdTech (Educational Technology) combines teaching methods with digital tools and technology-based learning resources. It includes online courses, educational software, coding platforms, artificial intelligence, robotics, and interactive learning systems.

Students can use these tools to explore concepts, practise new skills, and complete projects. Educators can also use technology to support classroom activities and monitor learning progress.

Read more about what EdTech means and how it works to understand its role in modern education.

Topics: EdTech, digital education, online learning, educational technology, STEM learning.
